Feature: UC-001 Place Order

  @UC-001.1
  Scenario: Should be able to place order for valid input
    Given a product with sku "BOOK-123", with unit price "20.00"
    And a country with code "US", with tax rate "0.10"
    When place order with sku "BOOK-123", with quantity 5, with country "US"
    Then should succeed

  @UC-001.1
  Scenario: Order status should be placed after placing order
    When place order
    Then should succeed
    And order has status PLACED

  @UC-001.1
  Scenario: Order prefix should be ORD
    When place order
    Then should succeed
    And order has order number prefix "ORD-"

  @UC-001.2
  Scenario: Should calculate base price as product of unit price and quantity
    Given a product with unit price "20.00"
    When place order with quantity 5
    Then should succeed
    And order has base price "100.00"

  @UC-001.2
  Scenario Outline: Should place order with correct base price parameterized
    Given a product with unit price <unitPrice>
    When place order with quantity <quantity>
    Then should succeed
    And order has base price <basePrice>

    Examples:
      | unitPrice | quantity | basePrice |
      | 20.00     | 5        | 100.00    |
      | 10.00     | 3        | 30.00     |
      | 15.50     | 4        | 62.00     |
      | 99.99     | 1        | 99.99     |

  @UC-001.3
  Scenario: Discount rate should be applied for coupon
    Given a coupon with coupon code "SUMMER2025", with discount rate "0.15"
    When place order with coupon code "SUMMER2025"
    Then should succeed
    And order has applied coupon "SUMMER2025"
    And order has discount rate "0.15"

  @UC-001.3
  Scenario: Discount rate should be not applied when there is no coupon
    When place order with coupon code none
    Then should succeed
    And order has applied coupon none
    And order has discount rate "0.00"
    And order has discount amount "0.00"

  @UC-001.3
  Scenario: Subtotal price should be calculated as the base price minus discount amount when we have coupon
    Given a coupon with discount rate "0.15"
    And a product with unit price "20.00"
    When place order with coupon code, with quantity 5
    Then should succeed
    And order has applied coupon
    And order has discount rate "0.15"
    And order has base price "100.00"
    And order has discount amount "15.00"
    And order has subtotal price "85.00"

  @UC-001.3
  Scenario: Subtotal price should be same as base price when no coupon
    Given a product with unit price "20.00"
    When place order with quantity 5
    Then should succeed
    And order has base price "100.00"
    And order has discount amount "0.00"
    And order has subtotal price "100.00"

  @UC-001.3
  Scenario: Order total should reflect coupon discount
    Given a coupon with coupon code "DISC10", with discount rate "0.10"
    When place order with coupon code "DISC10"
    Then should succeed
    And order has subtotal price "18.00"
    And order has discount rate "0.10"
    And order has applied coupon "DISC10"
    And order has total price "19.26"

  @UC-001.3
  Scenario: Order total should apply coupon discount and tax
