Feature: Untagged acceptance tests

  Scenario: Replaying an order with the same idempotency key should return the original order
    Given an order with idempotency key "ORDER-KEY"
    And logged in as customer
    When place order with order number "REPLAYED-ORDER", with idempotency key "ORDER-KEY"
    Then should succeed
    And order has order number DEFAULT_ORDER_NUMBER

  Scenario: Placing the same order twice without an idempotency key should create two orders
    Given an order
    And logged in as customer
    When place order with order number "SECOND-ORDER"
    Then should succeed
    And order does not have order number DEFAULT_ORDER_NUMBER
